From 3dff52c210368b3df4cf4c7e6b340c62a7ec5aee Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Abinash <abinash.haldorai@eka.care>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 18:40:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Console: show the calls a phone number has answered

A Calls tab on the number's page lists each call newest first: when, masked
caller, length, outcome, how it ended, staff handover and tools used, with
totals for the page and a link to the conversation.

The console index now always promotes `call` and `integration_uuid` from the
session context, so the page needs no extra CONSOLE_INDEX_CONTEXT_KEYS setting.
Sessions indexed before this change need a backfill to show up.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017jupsGPaMwDF6ADjpb25ED
